      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "OBJECTIVE",
          "Label": "OBJECTIVE",
          "content": "To enhance the understanding of obstructive sleep apnea hypopnea syndrome (OSAHS) and lower its misdiagnosis."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "METHODS",
          "Label": "METHODS",
          "content": "6 misdiagnosed cases were analyzed systemically."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "RESULTS",
          "Label": "RESULTS",
          "content": "OSAHS can be misdiagnosed as primary hypertension, arrhythmia, asthma, acalcerosis and some other diseases. The main causes of misdiagnosis were: the main complaints and the main signs could be one or more of a series of symptoms or signs of OSAHS itself or its complications and the lack of systemic knowledge of OSAHS."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "Label": "CONCLUSIONS",
          "content": "The understanding of OSAHS could be enhanced by analyzing misdiagnosis cases."
        }
      ]},
